  {"a": "A coffee house", "e": "Ship owners met at Edward Lloyd's coffee house to share news.", "p": "Lloyd's of London began its insurance business in what kind of place?", "s": "Banks and saving", "w": ["A printing house", "A goldsmith's shop", "A shipping office"]},
