  {"a": "A department store", "e": "The store gave the little book away at Christmas in 1939.", "p": "Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer was first written to bring customers to what?", "s": "Catalogues and advertising", "w": ["A railway company", "A sweet factory", "A toy workshop"]},
