  {"a": "Woke people for work", "e": "They tapped on bedroom windows with a long pole.", "p": "What did a knocker-upper do in a British factory town?", "s": "Factory and farm work", "w": ["Swept the streets", "Lit the street lamps", "Carried the letters"]},
